WEBVTT

00:05:00.246 --> 00:05:05.079
accepting what's true. Really one of
the most radical acts of my life.

00:05:05.079 --> 00:05:09.954
And I think any life, even if what's true
isn't what you want to be true. Right.

00:05:09.954 --> 00:05:14.746
Because then you can work from a place
of reality rather than delusion.

00:05:15.038 --> 00:05:18.746
And so I'm trying to accept
it and let go of.

00:05:20.288 --> 00:05:23.496
The future, or at least my sense of
knowing what's going to happen in

00:05:23.496 --> 00:05:26.704
the future, let's go into
the past a little bit.

00:05:26.746 --> 00:05:32.496
I'd love to talk to you a little bit
about how you have navigated